Z||000005||Archie||12-07-2001||12:11 AM||||The answers to your 3 questions is Yes, Yes, Yes.<P>Will all this fit in a Fiero? <P>No.<P>BTW, you can get the adapters etc. from Kennedy Engineered Products find them at <A HREF="http://kitcar.com/kennedy/home.html" TARGET=_blank>http://kitcar.com/kennedy/home.html</A>  they are the best at what you are talking about.<P>Archie<P>------------------<BR>Just how fast do you want to go?||||reg||1
